      "description": "The term 'nigger' is a historically and currently offensive racial slur used to demean and dehumanize Black people. Its use in the meme is central to its hateful intent, as it attempts to trivialize the offense by framing it as a minor '30-day ban'. This slur is deeply rooted in American racial history and is considered a form of racial violence and discrimination.",
