      "instance_name": "anti_black_stereotype",
      "label": "anti-Black stereotype",
      "description": "The meme relies on the stereotype that Black people are inherently violent or criminal, which is a common and harmful trope in racist discourse. The implication that calling someone 'nigger' is a minor offense is a direct attack on the dignity and humanity of Black people, reinforcing the idea that racial slurs are not serious or harmful.",
